# No End in Sight over The Ultimate Doom E1M1 (P10): from the map's start, no monsters: the player walks to the exit,
# through the doors on the way (and the keys they need), and leaves the level, the last
# tic. Written by tools/RouteGen (neis-e1m1-walk-exit).
iwad doom
pwad neis
map E1M1
exit normal
